{"id":"0a2d7611bb7648a0","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-clique-language.md","title":"团判定语言与补图","display":"df-clique-language — 团判定语言与补图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-clique-language","aliases":["73-df-clique-language"],"display":"df-clique-language — 团判定语言与补图","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4 and exercises, print pp. 459–476; PDF pp. 481–498; locally explicit complement-graph corollary","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-clique-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-clique-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clique-language — 团判定语言与补图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4 and exercises, print pp. 459–476; PDF pp. 481–498; locally explicit complement-graph corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_n\">\\(S\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline E\\coloneqq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in V_n\\land i&lt;j\\}\\setminus E,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Clique}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in S\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow\\{i,j\\}\\in E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline E\\coloneqq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in V_n\\land i&lt;j\\}\\setminus E,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Clique}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in S\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow\\{i,j\\}\\in E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CLIQUE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Clique}_{n,E}(S)\\land|S|\\ge k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CLIQUE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Clique}_{n,E}(S)\\land|S|\\ge k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补图只补不同顶点之间的边，不加入自环。团问题可由独立集通过补图立即得到，属于本节框架的本地推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline E\\coloneqq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in V_n\\land i<j\\}\\setminus E,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Clique}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\subseteq V_n\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in S\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow\\{i,j\\}\\in E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CLIQUE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land\n\\exists S\\subseteq V_n\\;(\\operatorname{Clique}_{n,E}(S)\\land|S|\\ge k)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1352,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-clique-language|团判定语言与补图]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"72b2b1213d426b99","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4f6d4d247465f3c9"]}